&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{{ … a_place_to_stay_curious:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let&#39;s build banking that works for people, one clean line of code at a time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;DKB Code Factory&lt;/strong&gt;, we&#39;re building the mobile banking app that small and mid-sized businesses actually need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Junior Android Developer&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll help turn that vision into a reliable, intuitive mobile experience. Working with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and modern Android technologies, you&#39;ll develop features that make everyday banking easier for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll collaborate with experienced teammates, contribute to technical decisions, and gradually take ownership of features from development to release. This is an opportunity to grow your engineering skills while building a product that makes a real difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;}};&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{{ your_responsibilities: [&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build features that matter:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and deliver Android features using Kotlin and Jetpack Compose, focusing on usability, performance, and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to a scalable foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; Help implement and improve our modular Android architecture using MVVM, Kotlin Coroutines, and Android architecture components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn ideas into working solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with product managers, designers, backend developers, and fellow engineers to transform requirements into functional mobile experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver a reliable MVP:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the team&#39;s goal of delivering 80% of prioritized MVP user flows, integrating backend APIs and ensuring a seamless user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write code we&#39;re proud of:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain high code quality through automated testing, code reviews, and clear documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make development better every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Support improvements to our CI/CD pipelines, development workflows, and shared components while learning from feedback and team discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;] };&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{{ following_qualifications_would_be_in_line_with_our_desired_profile_for_this_position: [&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Android development experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Around 1–3 years of hands-on experience building native Android applications, or equivalent experience gained through internships or personal projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kotlin knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; A solid understanding of Kotlin and familiarity with Jetpack Compose and modern Android development practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Android fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of Android architecture components, MVVM, and asynchronous programming with Kotlin Coroutines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working with RESTful APIs and Git-based development workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You care about writing clean, maintainable code and are eager to improve your testing and debugging skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative approach:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy solving problems with others, are open to feedback, and communicate confidently in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated testing frameworks such as JUnit and Espresso.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines and mobile app release processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Material Design guidelines and Google Play Store deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Java or working in Agile/Scrum teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;] };&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have the feeling you don&#39;t match every single requirement? Don&#39;t worry!&lt;/strong&gt; We encourage you to apply anyway, even if your qualifications don&#39;t align perfectly. You might still be just the right candidate for us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{{ … a_place_to_stay_together:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From morning dailies to after-work drinks, team spirit is essential to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What connects us is more than working on the same product. We share ideas, challenge each other&#39;s thinking, offer honest feedback, and support one another&#39;s development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great software comes from people who stay curious, take ownership, and grow together. Whether you&#39;re shipping your first feature or learning a new technology, you&#39;ll be part of a team that celebrates progress and success together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Besides our great community, we also offer numerous other&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dkbcodefactory.com/jobs/valencia#what-we-offer&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(45, 194, 107);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;} } ;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
