&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Regional Director, Sales for Germany, you’ll lead a high-performing team of Strategic &amp;amp; Major Account Executive professionals to grow adoption of GitLab’s AI-powered DevSecOps platform. You’ll be responsible for managing software sales, bookings, and revenue, while building strong relationships with new and existing customers who rely on GitLab to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, and reduce security and compliance risk. Reporting to the VP, Central EMEA, you’ll hire and develop top talent, set clear territory and industry strategies, and ensure your team’s sales plans align with GitLab’s overall growth goals in this market. In your first year, you’ll focus on building a strong team culture, deepening our presence with German clients, and consistently meeting or exceeding performance objectives in a fast-paced, open source software and SaaS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and motivate a team of Strategic &amp;amp; Major Account Executives focused on the German market to deliver software sales, bookings, and revenue results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive territory and industry planning by analyzing market dynamics, customer needs, and competitive trends to identify and execute on growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and own accurate sales forecasts, territory management plans, and growth strategies that align to GitLab’s overall revenue goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish, track, and report on key performance metrics for the team, and take action to address gaps and improve outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Renewals, Marketing, and other cross-functional partners to manage pipeline health, renewal performance, and deal execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, hire, and onboard top sales talent while building and maintaining a strong pipeline of potential future hires in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a high-performing, inclusive, and positive team culture through regular coaching, clear expectations, and ongoing development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate and enable your team on GitLab’s product, pricing, AI-powered DevSecOps positioning, and key industry and regulatory factors relevant to the German market, such as data privacy, data sovereignty, and sector-specific compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive experience in field sales and sales operations in an open source software, DevOps, or similar software-as-a-service environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading and developing account-focused sales teams, including hiring, coaching, and performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of meeting or exceeding performance objectives (revenue targets, pipeline targets, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and executing go-to-market strategies for the German market, with a willingness to both lead and participate directly in selling activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial and analytical skills to interpret sales performance data and adjust regional plans in ways that drive sustainable, long-term growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience working with CRM and sales/marketing tools (for example Salesforce, Clari, Marketo) to manage forecasts, territories, and pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze market trends, customer needs, and competitive dynamics to inform territory planning and team enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building, negotiation, and presentation skills, including executive-level written and verbal communication and the ability to mentor others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment with GitLab’s values and interest in open source, with openness to candidates who bring transferable leadership and regional sales experience from adjacent software markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_actions__container c-message__actions&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: xx-small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;Remote-Global&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Fraud Alert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve learned that scammers are impersonating Commvault team members—including HR and leadership—via email or text. These bad actors may conduct fake interviews and ask for personal information, such as your social security number. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to know:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commvault does&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;not&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;conduct interviews by email or text.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We will never ask you to submit sensitive documents (including banking information, SSN, etc) before your first day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commvault recruiters may contact prospective candidates through LinkedIn and other professional networking platforms regarding career opportunities. If you are unsure whether a recruiting communication is legitimate, review the profile to ensure they have a badge verifying them as a Commvault employee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you suspect a recruiting scam, please contact us at &lt;u&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Commvault&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault (NASDAQ: CVLT) is the gold standard in cyber resilience. The company empowers customers to uncover, take action, and rapidly recover from cyberattacks – keeping data safe and businesses resilient. The company’s unique AI-powered platform combines best-in-class data protection, exceptional data security, advanced data intelligence, and lightning-fast recovery across any workload or cloud at the lowest TCO. For over 25 years, more than 100,000 organizations and a vast partner ecosystem have relied on Commvault to reduce risks, improve governance, and do more with data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Commvault, we help some of the world’s most complex organisations strengthen their cyber resilience and protect what matters most: their data, operations and ability to recover.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are expanding our Enterprise Sales team in Germany and are looking an Enterprise Account Executive to cover &lt;strong&gt;Germany South&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not an account-maintenance role. We are looking for proven enterprise sellers who know their market, have built trusted relationships with senior customers and partners, and consistently turn market access into qualified pipeline, strategic opportunities and profitable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver quarterly and annual revenue targets across a defined portfolio of large enterprise customers and high-value prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute strategic territory and account plans focused on net-new logo acquisition, competitive displacement and sustainable account expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally create and progress qualified pipeline through executive engagement, targeted prospecting, customer referrals, partners and technology alliances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles involving CIOs, CISOs, infrastructure leaders, procurement, partners and executive sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling business cases that connect cyber resilience and data protection outcomes with financial value, risk reduction and operational priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate an integrated account team across Sales Engineering, Channel, Marketing, Customer Success, Professional Services and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate opportunity management, qualification and forecasting throughout the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long-term customer relationships based on credibility, business value and consistent delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Successful Candidates Will Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;demonstrable track record of achieving or exceeding quota&lt;/strong&gt; in enterprise software, SaaS, cybersecurity, data management, cloud infrastructure or a closely related market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience closing &lt;strong&gt;complex six- and seven-figure enterprise transactions&lt;/strong&gt; with long sales cycles and multiple decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of winning &lt;strong&gt;net-new enterprise customers&lt;/strong&gt;, not only expanding inherited accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;established and active network&lt;/strong&gt; across enterprise customers, C-level decision-makers, channel partners and technology alliances within the relevant German territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the German enterprise technology market, including customer priorities, competitive dynamics, procurement structures and partner ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to independently create access, shape opportunities and maintain momentum without relying on continuous management intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business-value selling, negotiation and executive communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined use of CRM, qualification methodology, account planning and forecasting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative leadership style combined with personal accountability, resilience and a strong desire to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory and Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role is field-based and should ideally be located within &lt;strong&gt;Germany South &lt;/strong&gt;with convenient access to major rail, road and air connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular customer and partner engagement across the assigned territory is an essential part of the role. Candidates should therefore be comfortable travelling based on customer and business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Define a Winning Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For us, a winning mindset is about:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating opportunities rather than waiting for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership from initial access through successful close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combining ambition with disciplined execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being transparent about risks, pipeline quality and forecast confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobilising the wider team while remaining personally accountable for the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning quickly, responding constructively to setbacks and maintaining momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Winning in a way that strengthens customer trust, partner relationships and the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you have consistently built enterprise pipeline, developed trusted executive relationships and converted complex customer challenges into significant business outcomes, we would like to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
